
Fact person Derived from family-of.person1
Fact family-of Identified by person1 * person2 Where person1 != person2
  Holds when family-of(person2, person1)
           , family-of(person2, person3) && family-of(person3,person1)
.

+family-of(Alice,Bob).
+family-of(Bob,Chloe).
+family-of(Chloe,David).
+family-of(David,Eve).
